  "url": "shaders/liquid-viscous.wgsl",
  "description": "A persistent 2D fluid state with midpoint semi-Lagrangian transport, streamline-aligned viscosity, Reynolds-number turbulence transition, shared-stencil vorticity confinement, a convergent local Jacobi projection, continuously drifting audio vortices, and per-band dye injection.",
